nodes.body:
Add `-> None` to the four new helper constructors. They currently omit the return annotation required by the repository's [constructor rule](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/631e146322af891b0c79b8d5a53bc579a69f01f3/style-guide.md#L16); the configured linters and formatters don't enforce it.

The replacement here is:
```suggestion
        def __init__(self, weight, pg_collection) -> None:
```
Apply the corresponding signature-only replacements to [TinyContextParallelModel](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/87caa9484aea693a2f71b1ccc7498653badb3996/tests/unit_tests/resharding/test_model_swap.py#L1009), [TinyModel](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/87caa9484aea693a2f71b1ccc7498653badb3996/tests/unit_tests/resharding/test_model_swap.py#L1107), and [LoopbackCopyService](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/87caa9484aea693a2f71b1ccc7498653badb3996/tests/unit_tests/resharding/test_mxfp8_refit.py#L385):
```python
def __init__(self, seed, pg_collection) -> None:
def __init__(self, value, pg_collection) -> None:
def __init__(self) -> None:
```
Keep their bodies unchanged, preserving model parameter/process-group setup and the loopback send/receive state used by both routed and CUTLASS-clamped cases. Acceptance is a static check that all four signatures declare `-> None` and no initialization or execution logic changes. No runtime test is needed for this annotation-only correction.

